# Manually-downloaded raw source artifacts (CBO XLSX/CSV, SSA HTML). Store them
# byte-for-byte as downloaded — never translate line endings — so the committed
# files are an exact copy of the operator's download and the pipelines parse the
# same bytes on every machine. See pipelines/cbo.py + pipelines/ssa.py.
pipelines/cbo_data/** -text
pipelines/ssa_data/** -text
